{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36927","headline":"第五将军于余杭天柱宫入道因题寄 · 罗隐","name":"第五将军于余杭天柱宫入道因题寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"交棃火枣味何如，闻说苕川已下车。\n瓦榼尚携京口酒，草堂应写颍阳书。\n亦知得意须乘鹤，未必忘机便钓鱼。\n欲恐武皇还望祀，软轮徵入问玄虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}